Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 08:43:50 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] !7650: Add support for AF_UNIX sockets

---
 dlls/ntdll/unix/file.c       |  14 +-
 dlls/ntdll/unix/socket.c     |   4 +
